OL,3,GNEWSAArt thief jailed after targeting
OL,4,AEdgar Davids
OL,5,
OL,6,FA friend of ex-Premier League star
OL,7,FEdgar Davids who stole his #188,000
OL,8,Fmodern art collection has been jailed
OL,9,Fin her absence for 28 months.
OL,11,FNabila Habiby, 39, sent multiple works
OL,12,Fof art belonging to Davids to auction,
OL,13,Fafter he had trusted her to put his
OL,14,Fpossessions into storage during a house
OL,15,Fmove.
OL,17,FTher former Spurs midfielder believed
OL,18,Fthe works were secured in a storage
OL,19,Ffacility in Enfield, north London and
OL,20,Fonly became suspicious when a luxury
OL,21,Fwatch went missing.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
