OL,3,GNEWSAArt thief jailed after targeting
OL,4,AEdgar Davids
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring sentencing on Wednesday at Wood
OL,7,FGreen Crown Court, Judge Alexander
OL,8,FJacobs said Habiby, who had failed to
OL,9,Fturn up for four previous court
OL,10,Fhearings, had a "streak of dishonesty
OL,11,Fthroughout her relationships with
OL,12,Fothers".
